name: tb_sim_high
dataset: tb_findings
measure: max(alert_score)
by[1]: entity_key
comparator: gte
threshold: 1
stormCap: 1000
severity: CRITICAL
description: "SIM-box suspected: the SIM scored at or above the Risk Score's high threshold with enough primary signals, persisted for enough days, not on the allow list and not in shadow mode (tb_findings.status = alert). A CDR pattern is evidence of consistency with a box, never proof"
